  "evidence": [
    "Root independently redecoded all fifteen complete original init/fini pairs from pinned image and freshly correlated physical owner COFF from full application build-qaqywyyb. Every selected original interval is disjoint from all existing source mappings; each original constructor has an existing source identity. Existing source-owned object bindings identify every selected receiver.",
    "Selected genuine globals: MultiWindow; NetMsgPrimary/Secondary; NewTechWindow; PickWinGlobal; PlanWindow; ConsolePrefWin/PrefWinButtonGroup; QuayleWinGlobal; ReportIfGlobal/ReportWinGlobal; ConsoleStatusWin; TutorialWindow; WorldClimateWorldWin; ConsoleGlobal. Their existing definitions and natural compiler lifetime operations implement the recovered startup/exit bodies. No new C++ code or compiler/build flag changes authorized.",
    "NetMsg arguments are4096,8,0 and-5,40,1. PlanWin/Console construction uses implicit most-derived flag1. Their exit helpers call the source-owned own-part destructor from adjusted GraphicWin receiver856DC0/939444, then GraphicWin destructor5D4DD0; preserve the actual virtual-base hierarchy, not manual receiver offsets. NetMsg/PrefWin same-TU relative construction orders agree with original slots.",
    "Authorize native unclaimed FILE bindings only, with complete exclusive original spans and current local compiler helper names. Preserve all existing program tokens, object identities, mappings, historical claims and discoveries. These helper names are current emission interpretations, not recovered original debug names or TU boundaries. Start-only object bindings do not grant allocation bounds.",
    "The guarded NewTech sprite array is excluded; its existing original cleanup identity and unresolved guard mismatch remain. Four middle-family globals without native object bindings are separate recovery work. This batch does not grant cross-TU/global CRT order, guarded-lifetime, strict linked preservation, dependency, runtime or game acceptance.",
    "Before bounded coordinator-reviewed integration require complete fresh prior owner measurements preserved, all thirty new body measurements, full source/object/claim continuity, reference/mapping checks, fresh complete application build/link, and independent actual-diff/pin/COFF review. Only native record may bank measured exact claims, preferably in a larger joint batch."
  ],
